*> vybe-test: cobol/cobol2023_intrinsics/date_of_integer_roundtrip_runtime
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_cobol2023_intrinsics.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-DATE PIC X(8) VALUE 20240229.
01 WS-INT PIC S9(7).
01 WS-OUT PIC X(8).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE WS-INT = FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(WS-DATE).
    COMPUTE WS-OUT = FUNCTION DATE-OF-INTEGER(WS-INT).
    DISPLAY WS-OUT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-OUT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "20240229"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [20240229] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

